# Baseline Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and configure secrets as needed.

# Cloudflare Workers AI for the knowledge hub.
# The worker only chooses a page id, the way Motkarta's concierge selects facts
# (https://github.com/tompat1/motkarta). The sentence stays in src/knowledge/hub.ts.
# Deploy with: npm run worker:deploy
# VITE_CLOUDFLARE_WORKER_URL=https://builder-knowledge.<account>.workers.dev
#
# Account storage is D1 (builder-accounts) on that worker.
# Profile pictures are stored in D1 until R2 is enabled, then bound as AVATARS / builder-avatars.
# Admin sign-in is the GitHub login listed in ADMIN_LOGINS (tompat1).
# Put these on the worker with wrangler secret put, not in this file:
# SESSION_SECRET, GITHUB_CLIENT_ID, GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET
# GitHub OAuth callback:
# https://builder-knowledge.thomasrynell.workers.dev/api/auth/github/callback

# Application Keys
# API_KEY=your_key_here
